{"page":20249,"part":1,"text":"○弩势第三\n\n弩不宜直其笔，直则无力，立笔左偃而下，最须有力。又云：须发势而卷笔，若折骨而争力。口诀云：凡傍卷微曲，蹙笔累走而进之。直则纵势失力，滞则神气怯散。大弩须侧锋，顾右潜，轻挫其揭。\n\n问曰：画字中心竖画也，令谓之弩，何也？\n\n论曰：弩者势微，弩曰弩在乎笔下行，若直置其画，则形圆势质，书之病也。《笔诀》云：弩笔之法，坚笔徐行，近左引势，势不欲引直，直则无力矣。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20249,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"66531fddcdaca61849023de47e5660967fb5a8af01ee5e60d24ab6bc831ec03f","textSha256":"66531fddcdaca61849023de47e5660967fb5a8af01ee5e60d24ab6bc831ec03f","fileSha256":"66531fddcdaca61849023de47e5660967fb5a8af01ee5e60d24ab6bc831ec03f","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20249-wolai-5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"永字八法 · ○弩势第三","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","originalPages":[],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":5,"sourceTextSha256":"5dc9de190bb60132472ba7e700db7b9a0d1c99e143acd83fc79199143094e25b","id":"39SvWhRt7QL3FLRgAHegcf","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"subHeader","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":5},{"start":7,"end":95,"sourceTextSha256":"0a84304e30fd9c2b4c764092aac4ffaaca05a350698b96b7ea3056e20a37440d","id":"piTFQUhDRv7irsVXbB2L9c","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":88},{"start":97,"end":116,"sourceTextSha256":"02ff34e0f58828566afe59776b2a9d1b74ff0c48d4894b0c15e6143821c0b530","id":"jNK4zXMqu4pZgQynSHrFMS","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":19},{"start":118,"end":185,"sourceTextSha256":"a280a21d831fcf256f474a4716a444fa56b070c83cac7b962e1a9d39ed9bc1aa","id":"